
This repository's code was copied from the ATLAS TDAQ package
"oks_utils" (https://gitlab.cern.ch/atlas-tdaq-software/oks_utils/)
(at the head of its master branch at the time, commit c2e7dfc7841e) in
November 2022; the carbon copy of that code can be found in commit
26f3bea21d572125ea286d234770fa47efb91e6d in this repo. Since then, the
code has been refactored for the DUNE DAQ and the package has been
renamed from "oks_utils" to "oksutils".

